{"study_accession":"PRJNA1328589","secondary_study_accession":"SRP620361","title":"RNA‑seq of TREM1 pathway activation in human monocytes and neutrophils","description":"This dataset contains bulk RNA‑sequencing profiles of primary human monocytes and neutrophils stimulated in vitro to activate the TREM1 signaling pathway. Monocytes from healthy donors were exposed to a plate‑bound TREM1 agonistic antibody or to a combination of purified peptidoglycan and PGLYRP1, alongside appropriate control conditions. RNA was collected after short‑term stimulation to capture early transcriptional responses. The resulting data can be used to characterize gene expression programs downstream of TREM1 in human myeloid cells and to derive pathway signatures for use in independent cohorts. Overall design: RNA-seq profiling of monocytes upon TREM1 activation was performed after stimulation with a TREM1 agonist antibody, isotype control, or PGN-Ecndss+PGLYRP1 for 4 hours.","pubmed":"42420283","geo_series":"","n_samples":32,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN51337932","study_accession":"PRJNA1328589","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"D4_Monocytes_PGN_PGLYRP1 medium","description":"D4_Monocytes_PGN_PGLYRP1 medium","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM9235695","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2026-05-14","attributes":[["source_name","Blood"],["tissue","Blood"],["cell_type","Monocytes"],["individual","D4"],["treatment","PGN_PGLYRP1 medium"],["geo_loc_name","missing"],["collection_date","missing"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR35398974","experiment_accession":"SRX30481707","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000","read_count":60591707,"base_count":3029585350,"first_public":"2026-05-14","experiment_title":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000 sequencing: GSM9235695: D4_Monocytes_PGN_PGLYRP1 medium Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN51337933","study_accession":"PRJNA132858